rdma-core (64.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release for DOCA-OFED coexistence (rdma-core 64.0 /
    IBVERBS_PABI_VERSION 64, compatible with DOCA 3.5+ / MLNX_OFED 2607.x+).
  * Replace upstream irdma provider with OOT for optimal support.
  * irdma: Add env param to enable vendor_err passthrough for CIEs.
  * irdma: Add UD queue depth clamping support.
  * irdma: Add env param for overriding user CQ size.
  * irdma: Add support for shared UD credit pool (default 64, 0666 shm perms).
  * irdma: Initialize shadow to odd and disable empty check for polling CQs.
  * debian: Add standalone ibverbs-providers-irdma-doca package for DOCA-OFED
    coexistence.

